      "id": "claim_fc485b5fc851457b9c9fc2f63bbdf7e9",
      "statement": "ICE candidates are not individually signaled; instead onicecandidate flushes the SDP to the server when candidate gathering finishes, and a per-peer waitIceCandidatesTimeout timer (default 2000 ms) flushes the SDP as a fallback so negotiation is not blocked indefinitely.",
